---
import { APPIMAGE_URL, WIN_SETUP_URL, OSX_SETUP_URL, ALL_RELEASES_URL, INSTALL_CMD } from '../data/release';
---
<section class="band" id="download"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="bandhead"><span class="tag">Download</span><h2 class="disp">Grab the beta</h2></div>
  <div class="dl">
    <div class="plat">
      <h3>Linux</h3><div class="os2">Any distro · Wayland &amp; X11</div>
      <p>Self-updating AppImage, or the one-liner:</p>
      <div class="cmd"><span class="p">$</span> <span class="cmdtext" id="installCmdDl">{INSTALL_CMD}</span> <button class="cp" data-copy="#installCmdDl" aria-live="polite" aria-label="Copy install command">copy</button></div>
      <a class="btn mint" href={APPIMAGE_URL}>↓ AppImage</a>
    </div>
    <div class="plat">
      <h3>Windows</h3><div class="os2">Windows 10 / 11 · per-user, no admin</div>
      <p>Run the installer; it updates itself on launch.</p>
      <a class="btn mint" href={WIN_SETUP_URL}>↓ Setup.exe</a>
    </div>
    <div class="plat">
      <h3>macOS <span class="tag">Early</span></h3><div class="os2">Apple Silicon · macOS 15+</div>
      <p>Self-updating installer, or the same one-liner as Linux:</p>
      <div class="cmd"><span class="p">$</span> <span class="cmdtext" id="installCmdMac">{INSTALL_CMD}</span> <button class="cp" data-copy="#installCmdMac" aria-live="polite" aria-label="Copy install command">copy</button></div>
      <a class="btn mint" href={OSX_SETUP_URL}>↓ Setup.pkg</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="notewarn">Beta: expect rough edges, and please file bugs. Builds are unsigned while signing is in the works, so Windows may show a SmartScreen warning; choose &ldquo;More info&rdquo; &rarr; &ldquo;Run anyway&rdquo;. On macOS, open the downloaded <code>.pkg</code> with right-click &rarr; Open; the one-liner installer skips that. <a href={ALL_RELEASES_URL}>All releases on GitHub →</a></p>
</div></section>
